  terminology server (server/terminology/data/loinc-verified.json).
- ICD-10-CM FY2027 (server/terminology/data/icd10cm-fy2027.json.gz): code
  descriptions and alphabetic index from CDC/NCHS, a US Government work in the
  public domain (https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/icd/icd-10-cm/).
- ICD-11 MMS 2026-01 (server/terminology/data/icd11-mms-2026-01.json.gz): code,
