- LOINC/RSNA Radiology Playbook attribute values (modality, body part, contrast) are
  recorded per LOINC radiology code; the Playbook itself is linked, not copied
  (https://playbook.radlex.org/).
- Reference intervals (server/results/reference_ranges.json) are facts transcribed
  from the cited public sources (NBME Laboratory Values, MedlinePlus Medical
  Encyclopedia and Lab Tests, and the cited journal articles); no source text is
  reproduced.
